OL,3,GNEWSALorry-damaged bridge fully reopens
OL,4,Aafter work
OL,5,
OL,6,FWokingham Borough Council said it is
OL,7,Fnow seeking to recover costs from
OL,8,Finsurers, thought to be about #60,000,
OL,9,Fand said it finished work on 8 October.
